"description":"My File Organizer​ allows you to arrange your local and cloud files in a single application. The application comes loaded with an inbuilt file viewer using which you can save any file on your primary cloud drives on your local device, You can also shift a file from one cloud drive to another.\n\nAbility to load documents, presentations, voice memos, pictures, and a lot more. \n\nNow easily fetch online content and manage files on your cloud drives, mobile device, and internet. \n\n1) Ability to fetch files from Dropbox, Box Drive, and Web.\n2) Inbuilt file manager to shift files in folders. \n3) Inbuilt document viewers and file players.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.49655000000000004689582056016661226749420166015625, "sellerUrl":"https://myfileorganizer.app", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"69638144", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":6527, "trackContentRating":"17+", "primaryGenreName":"Utilities", "primaryGenreId":6002, "userRatingCount":6527}, 
